      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get that but i dont want to go to the er if i dont have to, it's always so expensive and the wait is insane. i've had migraines like this before, just a really bad flare up. like, if i just take an extra pill and maybe some ibuprofen, it'll probably pass in an hour right? it's just a headache, i'm not even dizzy or anything, just feeling sick to my stomach.",
